SLYCUSTOM_SHIPPING_ENABLE_UNVALIDATE=Enable shipment unvalidate
SLYCUSTOM_SHIPPING_ENABLE_UNVALIDATETooltip=Allow users to unvalidate (set back to draft) confirmed shipments.
SLYCUSTOM_DASHBOARD_BOXES=Dashboard Widgets
SLYCUSTOM_DASHBOARD_BOXES_DESC=SLY Custom provides 9 replacement widgets: 5 (customer orders, actions, birthdays, supplier orders, supplier orders awaiting reception) + 4 invoice widgets with multicurrency (last customer bills, oldest unpaid customer bills, last supplier bills, oldest unpaid supplier bills). To use them: go to Dashboard setup, disable the original core widgets, and enable the SLY widgets (note: SLY).
SLYCUSTOM_GO_TO_DASHBOARD_SETUP=Go to Dashboard setup
SLYCUSTOM_SYNC_BOXES=Sync SLY boxes
SLYCUSTOM_SYNC_BOXES_TOOLTIP=If the SLY widgets do not appear in the dashboard setup, click this to register them into the database (e.g. after enabling the module before boxes were added).
SLYCUSTOM_BOXES_SYNCED=SLY boxes successfully synced. You can now add them in Dashboard setup.
SLYCUSTOM_PDF_TEMPLATES_SECTION=PDF templates (invoice / packing list)
SLYCUSTOM_SYNC_PDF_MODELS=Sync PDF templates to list
SLYCUSTOM_SYNC_PDF_MODELS_TOOLTIP=Register SLY invoice and packing list templates so they appear in the default PDF template dropdown (Setup → Invoices / Sendings). Run once if templates are missing.
SLYCUSTOM_PDF_MODELS_SYNCED=PDF templates (sly_invoice, sly_packinglist) synced. They should now appear in default template dropdowns.
