SLYCUSTOM_SYNC_MENU_ICONS_TOOLTIP=Update icons for "Search Order" and "SLY Exports" in the left menu. Click if icons are missing after enabling the module.
SLYCUSTOM_MENU_ICONS_SYNCED=Menu icons synced. Refresh the Tools or Commerce page to see the icons.
